@startuml
title UML - immutable audit source, native confirmation and durable progress
hide methods
class PendingAudit <<Finance original immutable>> {
 id : original event UUID
 record : original actor / payload / occurrence time
 deliveredAt : guarded one-time UTC?
}
class RelayCursor <<Finance mutable progress>> {
 lastId : attempted original UUID
 scannedAt : native UTC?
 page <= 50; work budget and timeout
 wraps after empty page
}
class DeliveryAttempt <<Finance immutable observation>> {
 id / auditId : UUID
 sourceDigest : original raw JSON SHA256
 outcome : safe enum; no raw exception
 attemptedAt : native UTC
}
class NativeAuditEvent <<Controls immutable authority>> {
 id / stream / original payload
 sequence / previousDigest / digest
 guarded idempotent append
}
class DeliveryReceipt <<Finance immutable native link>> {
 auditId : original UUID
 controlsDigest : accepted native chain digest
 controlsSequence : exact decimal string
 confirmedAt : native UTC
 origin : NATIVE_CONFIRMATION or LEGACY_VERIFIED
}
class ConfirmationFunction <<guarded native command>>
class ReceiptInquiry <<native read-only verifier>>
PendingAudit "1" -- "0..*" DeliveryAttempt
PendingAudit "1" -- "0..1" DeliveryReceipt
DeliveryReceipt "1" --> "1" NativeAuditEvent : exact ID / stream / payload / digest
RelayCursor --> PendingAudit : progress committed per attempted identity
ConfirmationFunction --> NativeAuditEvent : independently confirms accepted original
ConfirmationFunction --> DeliveryReceipt : atomic receipt + acknowledgment
ReceiptInquiry --> DeliveryReceipt
ReceiptInquiry --> NativeAuditEvent : rejects missing or damaged native links
note bottom of DeliveryReceipt
No caller-provided success flag, payload, digest or sequence.
Legacy migration preserves old delivery time and verifies original native evidence.
This receipt proves audit delivery; Core receipts prove financial completion.
end note
@enduml
